\p \v 24 \w Suddenly|strong="H116"\w* \w King|strong="H4430"\w* \w Nebuchadnezzar|strong="H5020"\w* \w jumped up|strong="H6966"\w* \w in amazement|strong="H927"\w* \w and asked|strong="H560"\w* \w his advisers|strong="H1907"\w*, “\w Did we not|strong="H3809"\w* \w throw|strong="H7412"\w* \w three|strong="H8532"\w* \w men|strong="H1400"\w*, \w firmly bound|strong="H3729"\w*, \w into|strong="H1459"\w* \w the fire|strong="H5135"\w*?”
