\p \v 25 “\w Look|strong="H1888"\w*!” \w he exclaimed|strong="H560"\w*. “\w I|strong="H576"\w* \w see|strong="H2370"\w* \w four|strong="H703"\w* \w men|strong="H1400"\w*, \w unbound|strong="H8271"\w* \w and unharmed|strong="H2257"\w*, \w walking around|strong="H1981"\w* \w in|strong="H1459"\w* \w the fire|strong="H5135"\w* — \w and the fourth|strong="H7244"\w* \w looks|strong="H7299"\w* \w like|strong="H1821"\w* \w a son|strong="H1247"\w* \w of the gods|strong="H426"\w*!\f + \fr 3:25 \ft Or \fqa like the Son of God\f*”
