\c 4
\s1 Nebuchadnezzar Confesses God’s Kingdom
\p \v 1 \w King|strong="H4430"\w* \w Nebuchadnezzar|strong="H5020"\w*,
\p \w To the people|strong="H5972"\w* \w of every|strong="H3606"\w* \w nation|strong="H524"\w* \w and language|strong="H3961"\w* \w who|strong="H1768"\w* \w dwell|strong="H1753"\w* \w in all|strong="H3606"\w* \w the earth|strong="H772"\w*:
\p \w May your prosperity|strong="H8001"\w* \w be multiplied|strong="H7680"\w*. \v 2 \w I am pleased|strong="H8232"\w* \w to declare|strong="H2324"\w* \w the signs|strong="H852"\w* \w and wonders|strong="H8540"\w* \w that|strong="H1768"\w* \w the Most High|strong="H5943"\w* \w God|strong="H426"\w* \w has performed|strong="H5648"\w* \w for me|strong="H5974"\w*.
