\s1 Nebuchadnezzar’s Dream of a Great Tree
\p \v 4 \w I|strong="H576"\w*, \w Nebuchadnezzar|strong="H5020"\w*, \w was|strong="H1934"\w* \w at ease|strong="H7954"\w* \w in my house|strong="H1005"\w* \w and flourishing|strong="H7487"\w* \w in my palace|strong="H1965"\w*. \v 5 \w I had|strong="H2370"\w* \w a dream|strong="H2493"\w*, \w and it frightened me|strong="H1763"\w*; \w while I was in|strong="H5922"\w* \w my bed|strong="H4903"\w*, \w the images|strong="H2031"\w* \w and visions|strong="H2376"\w* \w in my mind|strong="H7217"\w* \w alarmed me|strong="H927"\w*. \v 6 \w So|strong="H4481"\w* \w I issued|strong="H7761"\w* \w a decree|strong="H2942"\w* \w that all|strong="H3606"\w* \w the wise men|strong="H2445"\w* \w of Babylon|strong="H895"\w* \w be brought|strong="H5954"\w* \w before me|strong="H6925"\w* \w to|strong="H1768"\w* \w interpret|strong="H6591"\w* \w the dream|strong="H2493"\w* \w for me|strong="H3046"\w*. \v 7 \w When|strong="H116"\w* \w the magicians|strong="H2749"\w*, \w enchanters|strong="H826"\w*, \w astrologers|strong="H3779"\w*,\f + \fr 4:7 \ft Or \fqa Chaldeans\f* \w and diviners|strong="H1505"\w* \w came in|strong="H5954"\w*, \w I|strong="H576"\w* \w told them|strong="H560"\w* \w the dream|strong="H2493"\w*, \w but they could not|strong="H3809"\w* \w interpret it|strong="H6591"\w* for me.
\p \v 8 \w But at|strong="H5705"\w* \w last|strong="H318"\w*, \w into my presence|strong="H6925"\w* \w came|strong="H5954"\w* \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w* (\w whose|strong="H1768"\w* \w name is|strong="H8036"\w* \w Belteshazzar|strong="H1096"\w* \w after the name|strong="H8036"\w* \w of my god|strong="H426"\w*, \w and in whom|strong="H1768"\w* \w is the spirit|strong="H7308"\w* \w of the holy|strong="H6922"\w* \w gods|strong="H426"\w*). \w And I told him|strong="H560"\w* \w the dream|strong="H2493"\w*: \v 9 “\w O Belteshazzar|strong="H1096"\w*, \w chief|strong="H7229"\w* \w of the magicians|strong="H2749"\w*, \w I|strong="H576"\w* \w know|strong="H3046"\w* \w that|strong="H1768"\w* \w the spirit|strong="H7308"\w* \w of the holy|strong="H6922"\w* \w gods|strong="H426"\w* is in you \w and that|strong="H3606"\w* \w no|strong="H3809"\w* \w mystery|strong="H7328"\w* \w baffles|strong="H598"\w* you. \w So explain to me|strong="H560"\w* \w the visions|strong="H2376"\w* \w I saw|strong="H2370"\w* \w in my dream|strong="H2493"\w*, \w and their interpretation|strong="H6591"\w*. \v 10 \w In these visions|strong="H2376"\w* \w of my mind|strong="H7217"\w* \w as I was lying|strong="H5922"\w* \w in bed|strong="H4903"\w*, \w I saw this|strong="H2370"\w* \w come to pass|strong="H1934"\w*:
