\q2 \w in its branches|strong="H6056"\w* \w the birds|strong="H6853"\w* \w of the air|strong="H8065"\w* \w nested|strong="H1753"\w*,
\q2 \w and from it|strong="H4481"\w* \w every|strong="H3606"\w* \w creature|strong="H1321"\w* \w was fed|strong="H2110"\w*.
\p \v 13 \w As I lay|strong="H5922"\w* \w on my bed|strong="H4903"\w*, \w I also saw|strong="H2370"\w* \w in the visions|strong="H2376"\w* \w of my mind|strong="H7217"\w* \w a watcher|strong="H5894"\w*,\f + \fr 4:13 \ft Or \fqa an angelic watcher \ft or \fqa a messenger\ft ; also in verses 17 and 23\f* \w a holy one|strong="H6922"\w*, \w coming down|strong="H5182"\w* \w from|strong="H4481"\w* \w heaven|strong="H8065"\w*. \v 14 \w He called out|strong="H7123"\w* \w in a loud voice|strong="H2429"\w*:
\q1 ‘\w Cut down|strong="H1414"\w* \w the tree|strong="H363"\w* \w and chop off|strong="H7113"\w* \w its branches|strong="H6056"\w*;
