\s1 Daniel’s Visions Interpreted
\p \v 15 \w I|strong="H576"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w was grieved|strong="H3735"\w* \w in|strong="H1459"\w* \w my spirit|strong="H7308"\w*, \w and the visions|strong="H2376"\w* \w in my mind|strong="H7217"\w* \w alarmed me|strong="H927"\w*. \v 16 \w I approached|strong="H7127"\w* \w one|strong="H2298"\w* \w of|strong="H4481"\w* \w those who were standing there|strong="H6966"\w*, \w and I asked|strong="H1156"\w* \w him|strong="H4481"\w* \w the true meaning|strong="H3330"\w* \w of|strong="H5922"\w* \w all|strong="H3606"\w* \w this|strong="H1836"\w*.
\p \w So he told|strong="H560"\w* me \w the interpretation|strong="H6591"\w* \w of these things|strong="H4406"\w*: \v 17 ‘\w These|strong="H459"\w* \w four|strong="H703"\w* \w great|strong="H7260"\w* \w beasts|strong="H2423"\w* \w are|strong="H581"\w* \w four|strong="H703"\w* \w kings|strong="H4430"\w* \w who will arise|strong="H6966"\w* \w from|strong="H4481"\w* \w the earth|strong="H772"\w*. \v 18 \w But the saints|strong="H6922"\w* \w of the Most High|strong="H5946"\w* \w will receive|strong="H6902"\w* \w the kingdom|strong="H4437"\w* \w and possess|strong="H2631"\w* \w it|strong="H4437"\w* \w forever|strong="H5705"\w* — \w yes, forever|strong="H5705"\w* \w and ever|strong="H5957"\w*.’
\p \v 19 \w Then|strong="H116"\w* \w I wanted|strong="H6634"\w* \w to know the true meaning|strong="H3321"\w* \w of|strong="H5922"\w* \w the fourth|strong="H7244"\w* \w beast|strong="H2423"\w*, \w which|strong="H1768"\w* \w was|strong="H1934"\w* \w different|strong="H8133"\w* \w from|strong="H4481"\w* \w all the others|strong="H3606"\w* — \w extremely|strong="H3493"\w* \w terrifying|strong="H1763"\w* — \w devouring|strong="H399"\w* \w and crushing|strong="H1855"\w* \w with iron|strong="H6523"\w* \w teeth|strong="H8128"\w* \w and bronze|strong="H5174"\w* \w claws|strong="H2953"\w*, \w then trampling|strong="H7512"\w* \w underfoot|strong="H7271"\w* \w whatever was left|strong="H7606"\w*. \v 20 \w I also wanted to know about|strong="H5922"\w* \w the ten|strong="H6236"\w* \w horns|strong="H7162"\w* \w on its head|strong="H7217"\w* \w and the other|strong="H317"\w* \w horn that|strong="H1768"\w* \w came up|strong="H5559"\w*, \w before which|strong="H6925"\w* \w three of them|strong="H8532"\w* \w fell|strong="H5308"\w*— \w the horn|strong="H7162"\w* \w whose appearance was|strong="H2376"\w* \w more imposing than|strong="H4481"\w* \w the others|strong="H2273"\w*, \w with eyes|strong="H5870"\w* and with \w a mouth|strong="H6433"\w* \w that spoke|strong="H4449"\w* \w words of arrogance|strong="H7260"\w*. \v 21 \w As I|strong="H1934"\w* \w watched|strong="H2370"\w*, \w this|strong="H1797"\w* \w horn|strong="H7162"\w* \w was waging|strong="H5648"\w* \w war|strong="H7129"\w* \w against|strong="H5974"\w* \w the saints|strong="H6922"\w* \w and prevailing|strong="H3201"\w* against them, \v 22 \w until|strong="H5705"\w* \w the Ancient|strong="H6268"\w* \w of Days|strong="H3118"\w* \w arrived|strong="H858"\w* \w and pronounced|strong="H3052"\w* \w judgment|strong="H1780"\w* \w in favor of the saints|strong="H6922"\w* \w of the Most High|strong="H5946"\w*, \w and the time|strong="H2166"\w* \w came|strong="H4291"\w* \w for them|strong="H6922"\w* \w to possess|strong="H2631"\w* \w the kingdom|strong="H4437"\w*.
\p \v 23 \w This is what|strong="H3652"\w* \w he said|strong="H560"\w*: ‘\w The fourth|strong="H7244"\w* \w beast is|strong="H2423"\w* \w a fourth|strong="H7244"\w* \w kingdom|strong="H4437"\w* \w that will appear|strong="H1934"\w* \w on the earth|strong="H772"\w*, \w different|strong="H8133"\w* \w from|strong="H4481"\w* \w all|strong="H3606"\w* \w the other kingdoms|strong="H4437"\w*, \w and it will devour|strong="H399"\w* \w the whole|strong="H3606"\w* \w earth|strong="H772"\w*, \w trample it down|strong="H1759"\w*, \w and crush it|strong="H1855"\w*. \v 24 \w And the ten|strong="H6236"\w* \w horns|strong="H7162"\w* \w are ten|strong="H6236"\w* \w kings|strong="H4430"\w* \w who will rise|strong="H6966"\w* \w from|strong="H4481"\w* \w this kingdom|strong="H4437"\w*. \w After them|strong="H311"\w* \w another king|strong="H321"\w*, \w different|strong="H8133"\w* \w from|strong="H4481"\w* \w the earlier ones|strong="H6933"\w*, \w will rise|strong="H6966"\w* \w and subdue|strong="H8214"\w* \w three|strong="H8532"\w* \w kings|strong="H4430"\w*. \v 25 \w He will speak out|strong="H4449"\w* \w against|strong="H6655"\w* \w the Most High|strong="H5943"\w* \w and oppress|strong="H1080"\w* \w the saints|strong="H6922"\w* \w of the Most High|strong="H5946"\w*, \w intending|strong="H5452"\w* \w to change|strong="H8133"\w* \w the appointed times|strong="H2166"\w* \w and laws|strong="H1882"\w*; \w and the saints will be given|strong="H3052"\w* \w into his hand|strong="H3028"\w* \w for|strong="H5705"\w* \w a time|strong="H5732"\w*, \w and times|strong="H5732"\w*, \w and half|strong="H6387"\w* \w a time|strong="H5732"\w*.
\p \v 26 \w But the court|strong="H1780"\w* \w will convene|strong="H3488"\w*, \w and his dominion|strong="H7985"\w* \w will be taken away|strong="H5709"\w* \w and completely destroyed|strong="H8046"\w* \w forever|strong="H5705"\w*. \v 27 \w Then the sovereignty|strong="H4437"\w*, \w dominion|strong="H7985"\w*, \w and greatness|strong="H7238"\w* \w of|strong="H1768"\w* \w the kingdoms|strong="H4437"\w* \w under|strong="H8460"\w* \w all|strong="H3606"\w* \w of heaven|strong="H8065"\w* \w will be given|strong="H3052"\w* \w to the people|strong="H5972"\w*, \w the saints|strong="H6922"\w* \w of the Most High|strong="H5946"\w*. \w His kingdom|strong="H4437"\w* \w will be an everlasting|strong="H5957"\w* \w kingdom|strong="H4437"\w*, \w and all|strong="H3606"\w* \w rulers|strong="H7985"\w* \w will serve|strong="H6399"\w* \w and obey|strong="H8086"\w* Him.’
\p \v 28 \w Thus|strong="H3542"\w* \w ends|strong="H5491"\w* \w the matter|strong="H4406"\w*. \w As for me|strong="H576"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w my thoughts|strong="H7476"\w* \w troubled me|strong="H927"\w* \w greatly|strong="H7690"\w*, \w and my face|strong="H2122"\w* \w turned pale|strong="H8133"\w*. \w But I kept|strong="H5202"\w* \w the matter|strong="H4406"\w* \w to myself|strong="H3821"\w*.”
\c 8
\s1 Daniel’s Vision of the Ram and the Goat
\p \v 1 \w In the third|strong="H7969"\w* \w year|strong="H8141"\w* \w of the reign|strong="H4438"\w* \w of King|strong="H4428"\w* \w Belshazzar|strong="H1112"\w*, \w a vision|strong="H2377"\w* \w appeared|strong="H7200"\w* \w to me|strong="H413"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w subsequent|strong="H310"\w* \w to the one that had appeared|strong="H7200"\w* \w to me|strong="H413"\w* \w earlier|strong="H8462"\w*. \v 2 \w And in the vision|strong="H2377"\w* \w I saw|strong="H7200"\w* \w myself|strong="H589"\w* \w in the citadel|strong="H1002"\w* \w of Susa|strong="H7800"\w*, \w in the province|strong="H4082"\w* \w of Elam|strong="H5867"\w*. \w I saw|strong="H7200"\w* \w in the vision|strong="H2377"\w* \w that I|strong="H589"\w* \w was|strong="H1961"\w* \w beside|strong="H5921"\w* \w the Ulai|strong="H195"\w* \w Canal|strong="H180"\w*.
\p \v 3 \w Then I lifted up|strong="H5375"\w* \w my eyes|strong="H5869"\w* \w and saw|strong="H7200"\w* \w a ram|strong="H352"\w* with \w two horns|strong="H7161"\w* \w standing|strong="H5975"\w* \w beside|strong="H6440"\w* \w the canal|strong="H180"\w*. \w The horns|strong="H7161"\w* \w were long|strong="H1364"\w*, \w but one|strong="H259"\w* \w was longer|strong="H1364"\w* \w than|strong="H4480"\w* \w the other|strong="H8145"\w*, \w and the longer|strong="H1364"\w* \w one grew up|strong="H5927"\w* \w later|strong="H314"\w*. \v 4 \w I saw|strong="H7200"\w* \w the ram|strong="H352"\w* \w charging|strong="H5055"\w* \w toward the west|strong="H3220"\w* \w and the north|strong="H6828"\w* \w and the south|strong="H5045"\w*. \w No|strong="H3605"\w* \w animal|strong="H2416"\w* \w could stand|strong="H5975"\w* \w against him|strong="H6440"\w*, \w and there was no|strong="H369"\w* \w deliverance|strong="H5337"\w* \w from his power|strong="H3027"\w*. \w He did|strong="H6213"\w* \w as he pleased|strong="H7522"\w* \w and became great|strong="H1431"\w*.
\p \v 5 \w As I|strong="H589"\w* \w was|strong="H1961"\w* \w contemplating all this|strong="H995"\w*, \w suddenly|strong="H2009"\w* \w a goat|strong="H6842"\w* \w with a prominent|strong="H2380"\w* \w horn|strong="H7161"\w* \w between|strong="H996"\w* \w his eyes|strong="H5869"\w* \w came|strong="H935"\w* \w out of|strong="H4480"\w* \w the west|strong="H4628"\w*, \w crossing|strong="H5921"\w* \w the surface|strong="H6440"\w* \w of the entire|strong="H3605"\w* \w earth|strong="H776"\w* \w without|strong="H369"\w* \w touching|strong="H5060"\w* \w the ground|strong="H776"\w*. \v 6 \w He came|strong="H935"\w* \w toward|strong="H5704"\w* \w the two-horned|strong="H7161"\w* \w ram|strong="H352"\w* \w I had seen|strong="H7200"\w* \w standing|strong="H5975"\w* \w beside|strong="H6440"\w* \w the canal|strong="H180"\w* \w and rushed|strong="H7323"\w* \w at him|strong="H413"\w* \w with furious|strong="H2534"\w* \w power|strong="H3581"\w*. \v 7 \w I saw him|strong="H7200"\w* \w approach|strong="H5060"\w* \w the ram|strong="H352"\w* \w in a rage|strong="H4843"\w* \w against him|strong="H413"\w*, \w and he struck|strong="H5221"\w* \w the ram|strong="H352"\w* \w and shattered|strong="H7665"\w* \w his two|strong="H8147"\w* \w horns|strong="H7161"\w*. \w The ram|strong="H352"\w* \w was|strong="H1961"\w* \w powerless|strong="H3581"\w* \w to stand|strong="H5975"\w* \w against him|strong="H6440"\w*, \w and the goat threw him|strong="H7993"\w* \w to the ground|strong="H776"\w* \w and trampled him|strong="H7429"\w*, \w and|strong="H1961"\w* \w no one|strong="H3808"\w* \w could deliver|strong="H5337"\w* \w the ram|strong="H352"\w* \w from his power|strong="H3027"\w*.
\p \v 8 \w Thus the goat|strong="H6842"\w* \w became|strong="H5704"\w* \w very|strong="H3966"\w* \w great|strong="H1431"\w*, \w but at the height of his power|strong="H6105"\w*, \w his large|strong="H1419"\w* \w horn|strong="H7161"\w* \w was broken off|strong="H7665"\w*, \w and four|strong="H702"\w* \w prominent|strong="H2380"\w* \w horns came up|strong="H5927"\w* \w in its place|strong="H8478"\w*, \w pointing toward the four|strong="H702"\w* \w winds|strong="H7307"\w* \w of heaven|strong="H8064"\w*.
\p \v 9 \w From|strong="H4480"\w* \w one|strong="H259"\w* of these horns \w a|strong="H259"\w* \w little|strong="H6810"\w* \w horn|strong="H7161"\w* \w emerged|strong="H3318"\w* \w and grew|strong="H1431"\w* \w extensively|strong="H3499"\w* \w toward|strong="H413"\w* \w the south|strong="H5045"\w* \w and the east|strong="H4217"\w* \w and toward|strong="H413"\w* \w the Beautiful Land|strong="H6643"\w*. \v 10 \w It grew as high|strong="H1431"\w* \w as|strong="H5704"\w* \w the host|strong="H6635"\w* \w of heaven|strong="H8064"\w*, \w and it cast down|strong="H5307"\w* \w some of|strong="H4480"\w* \w the host|strong="H6635"\w* \w and some|strong="H4480"\w* \w of the stars|strong="H3556"\w* \w to the earth|strong="H776"\w* \w and trampled them|strong="H7429"\w*. \v 11 \w It magnified itself|strong="H1431"\w*, \w even to|strong="H5704"\w* \w the Prince|strong="H8269"\w* \w of the host|strong="H6635"\w*; \w it removed|strong="H7311"\w* \w His daily sacrifice|strong="H8548"\w* \w and overthrew|strong="H7993"\w* \w the place|strong="H4349"\w* \w of His sanctuary|strong="H4720"\w*. \v 12 \w And in the rebellion|strong="H6588"\w*,\f + \fr 8:12 \ft Or \fqa on account of transgression\f* \w the host|strong="H6635"\w* \w and the daily sacrifice|strong="H8548"\w* \w were given over to the horn|strong="H5414"\w*, \w and it flung|strong="H7993"\w* \w truth|strong="H571"\w* \w to the ground|strong="H776"\w* \w and prospered|strong="H6743"\w* \w in whatever it did|strong="H6213"\w*.
\p \v 13 \w Then I heard|strong="H8085"\w* \w a|strong="H259"\w* \w holy one|strong="H6918"\w* \w speaking|strong="H1696"\w*, \w and another|strong="H259"\w* \w holy|strong="H6918"\w* \w one said|strong="H559"\w* \w to him|strong="H1696"\w*, “\w How|strong="H5704"\w* \w long until the fulfillment of|strong="H4970"\w* \w the vision|strong="H2377"\w* \w of the daily sacrifice|strong="H8548"\w*, \w the rebellion|strong="H6588"\w* \w that causes desolation|strong="H8074"\w*, \w and the surrender|strong="H5414"\w* \w of the sanctuary|strong="H6944"\w* \w and of the host|strong="H6635"\w* \w to be trampled|strong="H4823"\w*?”
\p \v 14 \w He said|strong="H559"\w* \w to me|strong="H413"\w*, “\w It will take|strong="H5704"\w* \w 2,300|strong="H505"\w* \w evenings|strong="H6153"\w* \w and mornings|strong="H1242"\w*; \w then the sanctuary|strong="H6944"\w* \w will be properly restored|strong="H6663"\w*.”
\s1 Gabriel Interprets Daniel’s Vision
\p \v 15 \w While|strong="H1961"\w* \w I|strong="H589"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w was watching|strong="H7200"\w* \w the vision|strong="H2377"\w* \w and trying to|strong="H1245"\w* \w understand it|strong="H998"\w*, \w there|strong="H2009"\w* \w stood|strong="H5975"\w* \w before me|strong="H5048"\w* \w one having the appearance|strong="H4758"\w* \w of a man|strong="H1397"\w*. \v 16 \w And I heard|strong="H8085"\w* \w the voice|strong="H6963"\w* \w of a man|strong="H120"\w* \w calling|strong="H7121"\w* \w from between the banks of|strong="H996"\w* \w the Ulai|strong="H195"\w*: “\w Gabriel|strong="H1403"\w*, \w explain|strong="H995"\w* \w the vision|strong="H4758"\w* \w to this man|strong="H1975"\w*.”
\p \v 17 \w As he came|strong="H935"\w* \w near|strong="H681"\w* \w to where I stood|strong="H5977"\w*, \w I was terrified|strong="H1204"\w* \w and fell|strong="H5307"\w* \w facedown|strong="H5921"\w*.
\p “\w Son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of man|strong="H120"\w*,” \w he said|strong="H559"\w* \w to me|strong="H413"\w*, “\w understand|strong="H995"\w* \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w the vision|strong="H2377"\w* \w concerns the time|strong="H6256"\w* \w of the end|strong="H7093"\w*.”
\p \v 18 \w While he was speaking|strong="H1696"\w* \w with me|strong="H5973"\w*, \w I fell into a deep sleep|strong="H7290"\w*, \w with|strong="H5921"\w* \w my face|strong="H6440"\w* \w to the ground|strong="H776"\w*.
\p \w Then he touched|strong="H5060"\w* me, \w helped me to my feet|strong="H5975"\w*, \v 19 \w and said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Behold|strong="H2005"\w*, \w I will make known to you|strong="H3045"\w* \w what|strong="H834"\w* \w will happen|strong="H1961"\w* \w in the latter time|strong="H319"\w* \w of wrath|strong="H2195"\w*, \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w it concerns the appointed time|strong="H4150"\w* \w of the end|strong="H7093"\w*.
\p \v 20 \w The two-horned|strong="H7161"\w* \w ram|strong="H352"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w you saw|strong="H7200"\w* \w represents the kings|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Media|strong="H4074"\w* \w and Persia|strong="H6539"\w*. \v 21 \w The shaggy|strong="H8163"\w* \w goat|strong="H6842"\w* \w represents the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Greece|strong="H3120"\w*,\f + \fr 8:21 \ft Hebrew \fqa of Javan\f* \w and the large|strong="H1419"\w* \w horn|strong="H7161"\w* \w between|strong="H996"\w* \w his eyes|strong="H5869"\w* \w is|strong="H1931"\w* \w the first|strong="H7223"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w*. \v 22 \w The four horns|strong="H702"\w* \w that replaced|strong="H8478"\w* \w the broken one|strong="H7665"\w* \w represent four|strong="H702"\w* \w kingdoms|strong="H4438"\w* \w that will rise|strong="H5975"\w* \w from that nation|strong="H1471"\w* \w but will not have|strong="H3808"\w* \w the same power|strong="H3581"\w*.
\p \v 23 \w In the latter part|strong="H319"\w* \w of their reign|strong="H4438"\w*, \w when the rebellion|strong="H6586"\w* \w has reached its full measure|strong="H8552"\w*, \w an insolent|strong="H5794"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w*, \w skilled|strong="H995"\w* \w in intrigue|strong="H2420"\w*, \w will come to the throne|strong="H5975"\w*. \v 24 \w His power|strong="H3581"\w* \w will be great|strong="H6105"\w*, \w but it|strong="H3581"\w* \w will not be his own|strong="H3808"\w*. \w He will cause terrible destruction|strong="H7843"\w* \w and succeed|strong="H6743"\w* \w in whatever he does|strong="H6213"\w*. \w He will destroy|strong="H7843"\w* \w the mighty men|strong="H6099"\w* \w along with the holy|strong="H6918"\w* \w people|strong="H5971"\w*. \v 25 \w Through|strong="H5921"\w* \w his craft|strong="H7922"\w* \w and by his hand|strong="H3027"\w*, \w he will cause deceit|strong="H4820"\w* \w to prosper|strong="H6743"\w*, \w and in his own mind|strong="H3824"\w* \w he will make himself great|strong="H1431"\w*. \w In a time of peace|strong="H7962"\w* \w he will destroy|strong="H7843"\w* \w many|strong="H7227"\w*, \w and he will even stand|strong="H5975"\w* \w against|strong="H5921"\w* \w the Prince|strong="H8269"\w* \w of princes|strong="H8269"\w*. \w Yet he will be broken off|strong="H7665"\w*, \w but not|strong="H657"\w* \w by human hands|strong="H3027"\w*.
\p \v 26 \w The vision|strong="H4758"\w* \w of the evenings|strong="H6153"\w* \w and the mornings|strong="H1242"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w has been spoken|strong="H559"\w* \w is true|strong="H571"\w*. \w Now you|strong="H859"\w* \w must seal up|strong="H5640"\w* \w the vision|strong="H2377"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w it concerns the distant|strong="H7227"\w* \w future|strong="H3117"\w*.”
\p \v 27 \w I|strong="H589"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w was exhausted|strong="H1961"\w* \w and lay ill|strong="H2470"\w* \w for days|strong="H3117"\w*. \w Then I got up|strong="H6965"\w* \w and went about|strong="H6213"\w* \w the king’s|strong="H4428"\w* \w business|strong="H4399"\w*. \w I was confounded|strong="H8074"\w* \w by|strong="H5921"\w* \w the vision|strong="H4758"\w*; \w it was beyond|strong="H369"\w* \w understanding|strong="H995"\w*.
\c 9
\s1 Daniel’s Prayer for His People
\p \v 1 \w In the first|strong="H259"\w* \w year|strong="H8141"\w* \w of Darius|strong="H1867"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Xerxes|strong="H325"\w*,\f + \fr 9:1 \ft Hebrew \fqa Ahasuerus\f* \w a Mede|strong="H4074"\w* \w by descent|strong="H2233"\w*, \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w was made ruler|strong="H4427"\w* \w over|strong="H5921"\w* \w the kingdom|strong="H4438"\w* \w of the Chaldeans|strong="H3778"\w*\f + \fr 9:1 \ft That is, the Babylonians\f* — \v 2 \w in the first|strong="H259"\w* \w year|strong="H8141"\w* \w of his reign|strong="H4427"\w*, \w I|strong="H589"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w understood|strong="H995"\w* \w from the sacred books|strong="H5612"\w*, \w according to the word|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H3414"\w* \w the prophet|strong="H5030"\w*, \w that the desolation|strong="H2723"\w* \w of Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w* \w would last|strong="H4390"\w* \w seventy|strong="H7657"\w* \w years|strong="H8141"\w*.\f + \fr 9:2 \ft See \ref Jeremiah 25:11–12|JER 25:11-12\ref* and Jeremiah 29:10.\f* \v 3 \w So I turned my attention|strong="H5414"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the Lord|strong="H136"\w* \w God|strong="H430"\w* \w to seek Him|strong="H1245"\w* \w by prayer|strong="H8605"\w* \w and petition|strong="H8469"\w*, \w with fasting|strong="H6685"\w*, \w sackcloth|strong="H8242"\w*, \w and ashes|strong="H665"\w*.
\p \v 4 \w And I prayed|strong="H6419"\w* \w to the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w my God|strong="H430"\w* \w and confessed|strong="H3034"\w*, “\w O|strong="H577"\w*, \w Lord|strong="H136"\w*, \w the great|strong="H1419"\w* \w and awesome|strong="H3372"\w* \w God|strong="H410"\w*, \w who keeps|strong="H8104"\w* \w His covenant|strong="H1285"\w* \w of loving devotion|strong="H2617"\w*\f + \fr 9:4 \ft Forms of the Hebrew \fqa chesed \ft are translated here and in most cases throughout the Scriptures as \fqa loving devotion\ft ; the range of meaning includes \fqa love\ft , \fqa goodness\ft , \fqa kindness\ft , \fqa faithfulness\ft , and \fqa mercy\ft , as well as \fqa loyalty to a covenant\ft .\f* \w to those who love Him|strong="H157"\w* \w and keep|strong="H8104"\w* \w His commandments|strong="H4687"\w*, \v 5 \w we have sinned|strong="H2398"\w* \w and done wrong|strong="H5753"\w*. \w We have acted wickedly|strong="H7561"\w* \w and rebelled|strong="H4775"\w*. \w We have turned away|strong="H5493"\w* \w from Your commandments|strong="H4687"\w* \w and ordinances|strong="H4941"\w*. \v 6 \w We have not|strong="H3808"\w* \w listened|strong="H8085"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Your servants|strong="H5650"\w* \w the prophets|strong="H5030"\w*, \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w spoke|strong="H1696"\w* \w in Your name|strong="H8034"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w our kings|strong="H4428"\w*, \w leaders|strong="H8269"\w*, \w fathers|strong="H1"\w*, \w and|strong="H413"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the people|strong="H5971"\w* \w of the land|strong="H776"\w*.
\p \v 7 To You, \w O Lord|strong="H136"\w*, \w belongs righteousness|strong="H6666"\w*, \w but this|strong="H2088"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w* \w we are covered|strong="H6440"\w* \w with shame|strong="H1322"\w*— \w the men|strong="H376"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H3063"\w*, \w the people|strong="H3427"\w* \w of Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w*, \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w near|strong="H7138"\w* \w and far|strong="H7350"\w*, \w in all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the countries|strong="H776"\w* \w to which|strong="H834"\w* \w You have driven us|strong="H5080"\w* \w because of our unfaithfulness|strong="H4604"\w* to You. \v 8 \w O LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, we \w are covered|strong="H6440"\w* \w with shame|strong="H1322"\w* — \w our kings|strong="H4428"\w*, \w our leaders|strong="H8269"\w*, \w and our fathers|strong="H1"\w* — \w because|strong="H834"\w* \w we have sinned|strong="H2398"\w* against You.
\p \v 9 \w To the Lord|strong="H136"\w* \w our God|strong="H430"\w* \w belong compassion|strong="H7356"\w* \w and forgiveness|strong="H5547"\w*, \w even though|strong="H3588"\w* \w we have rebelled|strong="H4775"\w* against Him \v 10 \w and have not|strong="H3808"\w* \w obeyed|strong="H8085"\w* \w the voice|strong="H6963"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w our God|strong="H430"\w* \w to walk|strong="H1980"\w* \w in His laws|strong="H8451"\w*, \w which|strong="H834"\w* \w He set|strong="H5414"\w* \w before us|strong="H6440"\w* \w through|strong="H3027"\w* \w His servants|strong="H5650"\w* \w the prophets|strong="H5030"\w*.
\p \v 11 \w All|strong="H3605"\w* \w Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w has transgressed|strong="H5674"\w* \w Your law|strong="H8451"\w* \w and turned away|strong="H5493"\w*, \w refusing|strong="H1115"\w* \w to obey|strong="H8085"\w* \w Your voice|strong="H6963"\w*; \w so the oath|strong="H423"\w* \w and the curse|strong="H7621"\w* \w written|strong="H3789"\w* \w in the Law|strong="H8451"\w* \w of Moses|strong="H4872"\w* \w the servant|strong="H5650"\w* \w of God|strong="H430"\w* \w has been poured out|strong="H5413"\w* \w on us|strong="H5921"\w*, \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w we have sinned|strong="H2398"\w* against You. \v 12 \w You have carried out|strong="H6965"\w* \w the words|strong="H1697"\w* \w spoken|strong="H1696"\w* \w against us|strong="H5921"\w* \w and against|strong="H5921"\w* \w our rulers|strong="H8199"\w* \w by bringing|strong="H935"\w* \w upon us|strong="H5921"\w* \w a great|strong="H1419"\w* \w disaster|strong="H7451"\w*. \w For under|strong="H8478"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w of heaven|strong="H8064"\w*, \w nothing|strong="H3808"\w* \w has ever been done|strong="H6213"\w* \w like what|strong="H834"\w* \w has been done|strong="H6213"\w* \w to Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w*.
\p \v 13 \w Just as|strong="H834"\w* \w it is written|strong="H3789"\w* \w in the Law|strong="H8451"\w* \w of Moses|strong="H4872"\w*, \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w this|strong="H2063"\w* \w disaster|strong="H7451"\w* \w has come|strong="H935"\w* \w upon us|strong="H5921"\w*, \w yet we have not|strong="H3808"\w* \w sought the favor|strong="H2470"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w our God|strong="H430"\w* \w by turning|strong="H7725"\w* \w from our iniquities|strong="H5771"\w* \w and giving attention|strong="H7919"\w* \w to Your truth|strong="H571"\w*. \v 14 \w Therefore the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w has kept the calamity|strong="H7451"\w* \w in store|strong="H8245"\w* \w and brought it|strong="H935"\w* \w upon us|strong="H5921"\w*. \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w our God|strong="H430"\w* \w is righteous|strong="H6662"\w* \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w He does|strong="H6213"\w*; \w yet we have not|strong="H3808"\w* \w obeyed|strong="H8085"\w* \w His voice|strong="H6963"\w*.
\p \v 15 \w Now|strong="H6258"\w*, \w O Lord|strong="H136"\w* \w our God|strong="H430"\w*, \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w brought|strong="H3318"\w* \w Your people|strong="H5971"\w* \w out of the land|strong="H776"\w* \w of Egypt|strong="H4714"\w* \w with a mighty|strong="H2389"\w* \w hand|strong="H3027"\w*, \w and who made|strong="H6213"\w* for Yourself \w a name|strong="H8034"\w* \w renowned to this|strong="H2088"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w*, \w we have sinned|strong="H2398"\w*; \w we have acted wickedly|strong="H7561"\w*. \v 16 \w O Lord|strong="H136"\w*, \w in keeping with all|strong="H3605"\w* \w Your righteous acts|strong="H6666"\w*, \w I pray|strong="H4994"\w* \w that Your anger|strong="H639"\w* \w and wrath|strong="H2534"\w* \w may turn away|strong="H7725"\w* \w from Your city|strong="H5892"\w* \w Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w*, \w Your holy|strong="H6944"\w* \w mountain|strong="H2022"\w*; \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w because of our sins|strong="H2399"\w* \w and the iniquities|strong="H5771"\w* \w of our fathers|strong="H1"\w*, \w Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w* \w and Your people|strong="H5971"\w* \w are a reproach|strong="H2781"\w* \w to all|strong="H3605"\w* \w around us|strong="H5439"\w*.
\p \v 17 \w So now|strong="H6258"\w*, \w our God|strong="H430"\w*, \w hear|strong="H8085"\w* \w the prayers|strong="H8605"\w* \w and|strong="H413"\w* \w petitions|strong="H8469"\w* \w of Your servant|strong="H5650"\w*. \w For Your sake|strong="H4616"\w*, \w O Lord|strong="H136"\w*, \w cause Your face|strong="H6440"\w* \w to shine|strong="H215"\w* \w upon|strong="H5921"\w* \w Your desolate|strong="H8076"\w* \w sanctuary|strong="H4720"\w*. \v 18 \w Incline|strong="H5186"\w* \w Your ear|strong="H241"\w*, \w O my God|strong="H430"\w*, \w and hear|strong="H8085"\w*; \w open|strong="H6491"\w* \w Your eyes|strong="H5869"\w* \w and see|strong="H7200"\w* \w the desolation|strong="H8074"\w* \w of the city|strong="H5892"\w* \w that bears|strong="H7121"\w* \w Your name|strong="H8034"\w*. \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w we|strong="H587"\w* \w are not|strong="H3808"\w* \w presenting|strong="H5307"\w* \w our petitions|strong="H8469"\w* \w before You|strong="H6440"\w* \w because of|strong="H5921"\w* \w our righteous acts|strong="H6666"\w*, \w but|strong="H3588"\w* \w because of|strong="H5921"\w* \w Your great|strong="H7227"\w* \w compassion|strong="H7356"\w*.
\p \v 19 \w O Lord|strong="H136"\w*, \w listen|strong="H8085"\w*! \w O Lord|strong="H136"\w*, \w forgive|strong="H5545"\w*! \w O Lord|strong="H136"\w*, \w hear|strong="H7181"\w* \w and act|strong="H6213"\w*! \w For Your sake|strong="H4616"\w*, \w O my God|strong="H430"\w*, \w do not|strong="H408"\w* \w delay|strong="H309"\w*, \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w Your city|strong="H5892"\w* \w and Your people|strong="H5971"\w* \w bear|strong="H7121"\w* \w Your name|strong="H8034"\w*.”
\s1 Gabriel’s Prophecy of the Seventy Weeks
\p \v 20 \w While|strong="H5750"\w* \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w was speaking|strong="H1696"\w*, \w praying|strong="H6419"\w*, \w confessing|strong="H3034"\w* \w my sin|strong="H2403"\w* \w and that|strong="H2403"\w* \w of my people|strong="H5971"\w* \w Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w and presenting|strong="H5307"\w* \w my petition|strong="H8467"\w* \w before|strong="H6440"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w my God|strong="H430"\w* \w concerning|strong="H5921"\w* \w His|strong="H430"\w* \w holy|strong="H6944"\w* \w mountain|strong="H2022"\w*— \v 21 \w while|strong="H5750"\w* \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w was still praying|strong="H1696"\w*, \w Gabriel|strong="H1403"\w*, \w the man|strong="H376"\w* \w I had seen|strong="H7200"\w* \w in the earlier|strong="H8462"\w* \w vision|strong="H2377"\w*, \w came|strong="H5060"\w* \w to me|strong="H413"\w* \w in swift flight|strong="H3288"\w* \w about the time|strong="H6256"\w* \w of the evening|strong="H6153"\w* \w sacrifice|strong="H4503"\w*. \v 22 \w He instructed me|strong="H995"\w* \w and spoke|strong="H1696"\w* \w with me|strong="H5973"\w*, \w saying|strong="H559"\w*: “\w O Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w I have come|strong="H3318"\w* \w now|strong="H6258"\w* \w to give you insight|strong="H7919"\w* \w and understanding|strong="H998"\w*. \v 23 \w At the beginning|strong="H8462"\w* \w of your petitions|strong="H8469"\w*, \w an answer|strong="H1697"\w* \w went out|strong="H3318"\w*, \w and I|strong="H589"\w* \w have come|strong="H935"\w* \w to tell you|strong="H5046"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w you are|strong="H859"\w* \w highly precious|strong="H2530"\w*. \w So consider|strong="H995"\w* \w the message|strong="H1697"\w* \w and understand|strong="H995"\w* \w the vision|strong="H4758"\w*:
\p \v 24 \w Seventy|strong="H7657"\w* \w weeks|strong="H7620"\w*\f + \fr 9:24 \ft Or \fqa Seventy sevens\ft ; also twice in verse 25 and once in verse 26 \f* \w are decreed|strong="H2852"\w* \w for|strong="H5921"\w* \w your people|strong="H5971"\w* \w and your holy|strong="H6944"\w* \w city|strong="H5892"\w* \w to stop|strong="H3615"\w* \w their transgression|strong="H6588"\w*, \w to put an end|strong="H2856"\w* \w to sin|strong="H2403"\w*, \w to make atonement|strong="H3722"\w* \w for iniquity|strong="H5771"\w*, \w to bring in|strong="H935"\w* \w everlasting|strong="H5769"\w* \w righteousness|strong="H6664"\w*, \w to seal up|strong="H2856"\w* \w vision|strong="H2377"\w* \w and prophecy|strong="H5030"\w*, \w and to anoint|strong="H4886"\w* \w the Most Holy Place|strong="H6944"\w*.\f + \fr 9:24 \ft Or \fqa the Holy of Holies \ft or \fqa the Most Holy One\ft ; literally \fqa the Most Holy\f*
\p \v 25 \w Know|strong="H3045"\w* \w and understand this|strong="H7919"\w*: \w From|strong="H4480"\w* \w the issuance|strong="H4161"\w* \w of the decree|strong="H1697"\w* \w to restore|strong="H7725"\w* \w and rebuild|strong="H1129"\w* \w Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w the Messiah|strong="H4899"\w*,\f + \fr 9:25 \ft Or \fqa the Anointed One\ft ; also in verse 26\f* \w the Prince|strong="H5057"\w*, \w there will be seven|strong="H7651"\w* \w weeks|strong="H7620"\w* \w and sixty-two|strong="H8346"\w* \w weeks|strong="H7620"\w*. \w It will be rebuilt|strong="H7725"\w* \w with streets|strong="H7339"\w* \w and a trench|strong="H2742"\w*, \w but in times|strong="H6256"\w* \w of distress|strong="H6695"\w*.
\p \v 26 \w Then after|strong="H310"\w* \w the sixty-two|strong="H8346"\w* \w weeks|strong="H7620"\w*\f + \fr 9:26 \ft Hebrew \fqa Then after sixty-two sevens\f* \w the Messiah|strong="H4899"\w* \w will be cut off|strong="H3772"\w* \w and will have nothing|strong="H369"\w*.
\p \w Then the people|strong="H5971"\w* \w of the prince|strong="H5057"\w* \w who is to come|strong="H935"\w* \w will destroy|strong="H7843"\w* \w the city|strong="H5892"\w* \w and the sanctuary|strong="H6944"\w*. \w The end|strong="H7093"\w* \w will come like a flood|strong="H7858"\w*, \w and until|strong="H5704"\w* \w the end|strong="H7093"\w* \w there will be war|strong="H4421"\w*; \w desolations|strong="H8074"\w* \w have been decreed|strong="H2782"\w*. \v 27 \w And he will confirm|strong="H1396"\w* \w a covenant|strong="H1285"\w* \w with many|strong="H7227"\w* \w for one|strong="H259"\w* \w week|strong="H7620"\w*,\f + \fr 9:27 \ft Or \fqa for one seven\ft ; similarly again in this verse\f* \w but in the middle|strong="H2677"\w* \w of the week|strong="H7620"\w* \w he will put an end|strong="H7673"\w* \w to sacrifice|strong="H2077"\w* \w and offering|strong="H4503"\w*. \w And on|strong="H5921"\w* \w the wing of the temple|strong="H3671"\w* \w will come the abomination|strong="H8251"\w* \w that causes desolation|strong="H8074"\w*,\f + \fr 9:27 \ft Literally \fqa And on the wing (will come) the abomination that causes desolation, \ft or \fqa And on the wing of abominations (will come) one who causes desolation,\f* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w the decreed|strong="H2782"\w* \w destruction|strong="H3617"\w* \w is poured out|strong="H5413"\w* \w upon|strong="H5921"\w* \w him|strong="H8074"\w*.\f + \fr 9:27 \ft Literally \fqa until the decreed consummation is poured out upon (him who) is desolate.\f*”
\c 10
\s1 Daniel’s Vision by the Tigris
\p \v 1 \w In the third|strong="H7969"\w* \w year|strong="H8141"\w* \w of Cyrus|strong="H3566"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Persia|strong="H6539"\w*, \w a message|strong="H1697"\w* \w was revealed|strong="H1540"\w* \w to Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w was called|strong="H7121"\w* \w Belteshazzar|strong="H1095"\w*. \w The message|strong="H1697"\w* \w was true|strong="H571"\w*, \w and it concerned a great|strong="H1419"\w* \w conflict|strong="H6635"\w*.\f + \fr 10:1 \ft Or \fqa true and greatly burdensome\f* \w And the understanding|strong="H998"\w* \w of the message|strong="H1697"\w* \w was given to him|strong="H995"\w* \w in a vision|strong="H4758"\w*.
\p \v 2 \w In those|strong="H1992"\w* \w days|strong="H3117"\w* \w I|strong="H589"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w was|strong="H1961"\w* \w mourning|strong="H56"\w* \w for three|strong="H7969"\w* \w full|strong="H3117"\w* \w weeks|strong="H7620"\w*. \v 3 \w I ate|strong="H398"\w* \w no|strong="H3808"\w* \w rich|strong="H2532"\w* \w food|strong="H3899"\w*, \w no|strong="H3808"\w* \w meat|strong="H1320"\w* \w or wine|strong="H3196"\w* \w entered|strong="H935"\w* \w my mouth|strong="H6310"\w*, \w and I did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w anoint myself with oil|strong="H5480"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w the three|strong="H7969"\w* \w weeks|strong="H7620"\w* \w were completed|strong="H4390"\w*.
\p \v 4 \w On the twenty-fourth|strong="H6242"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w* \w of the first|strong="H7223"\w* \w month|strong="H2320"\w*, \w as I|strong="H589"\w* \w was|strong="H1961"\w* \w standing on|strong="H5921"\w* \w the bank|strong="H3027"\w* \w of the great|strong="H1419"\w* \w river|strong="H5104"\w*, \w the Tigris|strong="H2313"\w*, \v 5 \w I lifted up|strong="H5375"\w* \w my eyes|strong="H5869"\w*, \w and behold|strong="H2009"\w*, \w there was a certain|strong="H259"\w* \w man|strong="H376"\w* \w dressed|strong="H3847"\w* \w in linen|strong="H906"\w*, \w with a belt|strong="H2296"\w* \w of fine gold|strong="H3800"\w* \w from Uphaz|strong="H210"\w* \w around his waist|strong="H4975"\w*. \v 6 \w His body was|strong="H1472"\w* \w like beryl|strong="H8658"\w*, \w his face|strong="H6440"\w* \w like the brilliance|strong="H4758"\w* \w of lightning|strong="H1300"\w*, \w his eyes|strong="H5869"\w* \w like flaming|strong="H784"\w* \w torches|strong="H3940"\w*, \w his arms|strong="H2220"\w* \w and legs|strong="H4772"\w* \w like the gleam|strong="H5869"\w* \w of polished|strong="H7044"\w* \w bronze|strong="H5178"\w*, \w and|strong="H6963"\w* \w his voice|strong="H1697"\w* \w like the sound|strong="H6963"\w* \w of a multitude|strong="H1995"\w*.
\p \v 7 \w Only|strong="H905"\w* \w I|strong="H589"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w saw|strong="H7200"\w* \w the vision|strong="H4759"\w*; \w the men|strong="H582"\w* \w with me|strong="H5973"\w* \w did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w see it|strong="H7200"\w*, \w but|strong="H61"\w* \w a great|strong="H1419"\w* \w terror|strong="H2731"\w* \w fell|strong="H5307"\w* \w upon them|strong="H5921"\w*, \w and they ran|strong="H1272"\w* \w and hid themselves|strong="H2244"\w*.
\p \v 8 \w So I|strong="H589"\w* \w was left alone|strong="H7604"\w*, \w gazing at|strong="H7200"\w* \w this|strong="H2063"\w* \w great|strong="H1419"\w* \w vision|strong="H4759"\w*. \w No|strong="H3808"\w* \w strength|strong="H3581"\w* \w remained|strong="H7604"\w* in me; \w my face|strong="H1935"\w* \w grew|strong="H2015"\w* \w deathly pale|strong="H4889"\w*, \w and I was powerless|strong="H3808"\w*. \v 9 \w I heard|strong="H8085"\w* \w the sound|strong="H6963"\w* \w of his words|strong="H1697"\w*, \w and as I listened|strong="H8085"\w*, \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w fell into a deep sleep|strong="H7290"\w*, \w with my face|strong="H6440"\w* \w to the ground|strong="H776"\w*.
\p \v 10 \w Suddenly|strong="H2009"\w*, \w a hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w touched|strong="H5060"\w* me \w and set me trembling|strong="H5128"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w my hands|strong="H3709"\w* \w and knees|strong="H1290"\w*. \v 11 \w He said|strong="H559"\w* \w to me|strong="H413"\w*, “\w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w you are a man|strong="H376"\w* \w who is highly precious|strong="H2532"\w*. \w Consider carefully|strong="H995"\w* \w the words|strong="H1697"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w I am|strong="H595"\w* \w about to say|strong="H1696"\w* \w to you|strong="H413"\w*. \w Stand up|strong="H5975"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w I have now|strong="H6258"\w* \w been sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w to you|strong="H413"\w*.”
\p \w And when he had said|strong="H1696"\w* \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w to me|strong="H5973"\w*, \w I stood up|strong="H5975"\w* \w trembling|strong="H7460"\w*.
\p \v 12 “\w Do not|strong="H408"\w* \w be afraid|strong="H3372"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*,” \w he said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the first|strong="H7223"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w you purposed|strong="H5414"\w* \w to understand|strong="H995"\w* \w and to humble|strong="H6031"\w* \w yourself before|strong="H6440"\w* \w your God|strong="H430"\w*, \w your words|strong="H1697"\w* \w were heard|strong="H8085"\w*, \w and I|strong="H589"\w* \w have come|strong="H935"\w* \w in response to them|strong="H1697"\w*. \v 13 \w However, the prince|strong="H8269"\w* \w of the kingdom|strong="H4438"\w* \w of Persia|strong="H6539"\w* \w opposed|strong="H5975"\w* \w me|strong="H5048"\w* \w for twenty-one|strong="H6242"\w* \w days|strong="H3117"\w*. \w Then Michael|strong="H4317"\w*, \w one|strong="H259"\w* \w of the chief|strong="H7223"\w* \w princes|strong="H8269"\w*, \w came|strong="H935"\w* \w to help me|strong="H5826"\w*, \w for I|strong="H589"\w* \w had been left|strong="H3498"\w* \w there|strong="H8033"\w* \w with|strong="H681"\w* \w the kings|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Persia|strong="H6539"\w*. \v 14 \w Now I have come|strong="H935"\w* \w to explain to you|strong="H995"\w* \w what|strong="H834"\w* \w will happen|strong="H7136"\w* \w to your people|strong="H5971"\w* \w in the latter|strong="H319"\w* \w days|strong="H3117"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w the vision|strong="H2377"\w* \w concerns those days|strong="H3117"\w*.”
\p \v 15 \w While he was speaking|strong="H1696"\w* \w these|strong="H428"\w* \w words|strong="H1697"\w* \w to me|strong="H5973"\w*, \w I set|strong="H5414"\w* \w my face|strong="H6440"\w* \w toward the ground|strong="H776"\w* \w and became speechless|strong="H481"\w*. \v 16 \w And suddenly|strong="H2009"\w* \w one with the likeness|strong="H1823"\w* \w of a man|strong="H120"\w*\f + \fr 10:16 \ft Most MT manuscripts; literally \fqa with the likeness of sons of man\ft ; DSS, LXX, and one MT manuscript \fqa with the likeness of the hand of a man\f* \w touched|strong="H5060"\w* \w my lips|strong="H8193"\w*, \w and I opened|strong="H6605"\w* \w my mouth|strong="H6310"\w* \w and said|strong="H559"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the one standing|strong="H5975"\w* \w before me|strong="H5048"\w*, “\w My lord|strong="H113"\w*, \w because of the vision|strong="H4759"\w*, \w I am overcome|strong="H2015"\w* \w with anguish|strong="H6735"\w*, \w and I have|strong="H6113"\w* \w no|strong="H3808"\w* \w strength|strong="H3581"\w*. \v 17 \w How|strong="H1963"\w* \w can I|strong="H3201"\w*, \w your|strong="H113"\w* \w servant|strong="H5650"\w*, \w speak|strong="H1696"\w* \w with|strong="H5973"\w* \w you|strong="H2088"\w*, \w my lord|strong="H113"\w*? \w Now|strong="H6258"\w* \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w have|strong="H5975"\w* \w no|strong="H3808"\w* \w strength|strong="H3581"\w*, \w nor|strong="H3808"\w* \w is any breath|strong="H5397"\w* \w left|strong="H7604"\w* in me.”
\p \v 18 \w Again|strong="H3254"\w* \w the one with the likeness|strong="H4758"\w* \w of a man|strong="H120"\w* \w touched|strong="H5060"\w* me \w and strengthened me|strong="H2388"\w*. \v 19 “\w Do not|strong="H408"\w* \w be afraid|strong="H3372"\w*, \w you who are highly precious|strong="H2532"\w*,” \w he said|strong="H559"\w*. “\w Peace be|strong="H7965"\w* with you! \w Be strong now|strong="H2388"\w*; \w be very strong|strong="H2388"\w*!”
\p \w As he spoke|strong="H1696"\w* \w with me|strong="H5973"\w*, \w I was strengthened|strong="H2388"\w* \w and said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Speak|strong="H1696"\w*, \w my lord|strong="H113"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w you have strengthened me|strong="H2388"\w*.”
\p \v 20 “\w Do you know|strong="H3045"\w* \w why|strong="H4100"\w* \w I have come|strong="H935"\w* \w to you|strong="H413"\w*?” \w he said|strong="H559"\w*. “\w I must return|strong="H7725"\w* \w at once|strong="H6258"\w* \w to fight|strong="H3898"\w* \w against|strong="H5973"\w* \w the prince|strong="H8269"\w* \w of Persia|strong="H6539"\w*, \w and when I|strong="H589"\w* \w have gone forth|strong="H3318"\w*, \w behold|strong="H2009"\w*, \w the prince|strong="H8269"\w* \w of Greece|strong="H3120"\w*\f + \fr 10:20 \ft Hebrew \fqa of Javan\f* \w will come|strong="H935"\w*. \v 21 \w But first|strong="H61"\w* \w I will tell|strong="H5046"\w* you \w what is inscribed|strong="H7559"\w* \w in the Book|strong="H3791"\w* \w of Truth|strong="H571"\w*. \w Yet no|strong="H369"\w* \w one|strong="H259"\w* \w has the courage|strong="H2388"\w* \w to support me|strong="H5973"\w* \w against|strong="H5921"\w* \w these|strong="H428"\w*, \w except|strong="H3588"\w* \w Michael|strong="H4317"\w* \w your prince|strong="H8269"\w*.[’’]
\c 11
\s1 Kings of the South and North
\p \v 1 “\w And I|strong="H589"\w*, \w in the first|strong="H259"\w* \w year|strong="H8141"\w* \w of Darius|strong="H1867"\w* \w the Mede|strong="H4075"\w*, \w stood up|strong="H5975"\w* \w to strengthen|strong="H2388"\w* \w and protect|strong="H4581"\w* him.
\p \v 2 \w Now then|strong="H6258"\w*, \w I will tell|strong="H5046"\w* you \w the truth|strong="H571"\w*: \w Three|strong="H7969"\w* \w more|strong="H5750"\w* \w kings|strong="H4428"\w* \w will arise|strong="H5975"\w* \w in Persia|strong="H6539"\w*, \w and then a fourth|strong="H7243"\w*, \w who will be|strong="H6239"\w* \w far|strong="H1419"\w* \w richer|strong="H6238"\w* \w than all the others|strong="H3605"\w*. \w By the power|strong="H2393"\w* \w of his wealth|strong="H6239"\w*, \w he will stir up|strong="H5782"\w* \w everyone|strong="H3605"\w* \w against|strong="H853"\w* \w the kingdom|strong="H4438"\w* \w of Greece|strong="H3120"\w*.\f + \fr 11:2 \ft Hebrew \fqa of Javan\f*
\p \v 3 \w Then a mighty|strong="H1368"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w will arise|strong="H5975"\w*, \w who will rule|strong="H4910"\w* \w with great|strong="H7227"\w* \w authority|strong="H4474"\w* \w and do|strong="H6213"\w* \w as he pleases|strong="H7522"\w*. \v 4 \w But as soon as he is established|strong="H5975"\w*, \w his kingdom|strong="H4438"\w* \w will be broken up|strong="H7665"\w* \w and parceled|strong="H2673"\w* \w out toward the four|strong="H702"\w* \w winds|strong="H7307"\w* \w of heaven|strong="H8064"\w*. \w It will not go|strong="H3808"\w* \w to his descendants|strong="H319"\w*, \w nor will it|strong="H3808"\w* \w have the authority|strong="H4915"\w* \w with which|strong="H834"\w* \w he ruled|strong="H4910"\w*, \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w his kingdom|strong="H4438"\w* \w will be uprooted|strong="H5428"\w* \w and given to others|strong="H312"\w*.
\p \v 5 \w The king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the South|strong="H5045"\w* \w will grow strong|strong="H2388"\w*, \w but one of|strong="H4480"\w* \w his commanders|strong="H8269"\w* \w will grow even|strong="H5921"\w* \w stronger|strong="H2388"\w* \w and will rule|strong="H4910"\w* \w his own kingdom|strong="H4474"\w* \w with great|strong="H7227"\w* \w authority|strong="H4475"\w*.
\p \v 6 \w After|strong="H7093"\w* \w some years|strong="H8141"\w* \w they will form an alliance|strong="H2266"\w*, \w and the daughter|strong="H1323"\w* \w of the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the South|strong="H5045"\w* \w will go|strong="H935"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the North|strong="H6828"\w* \w to seal|strong="H6213"\w* \w the agreement|strong="H4339"\w*. \w But his daughter will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w retain|strong="H6113"\w* \w her position of power|strong="H3581"\w*, \w nor will|strong="H3808"\w* \w his strength|strong="H2220"\w*\f + \fr 11:6 \ft Or \fqa offspring\f* \w endure|strong="H5975"\w*. \w At that time|strong="H6256"\w* \w she|strong="H1931"\w* \w will be given up|strong="H5414"\w*, \w along with her royal escort|strong="H935"\w* \w and her father|strong="H3205"\w*\f + \fr 11:6 \ft Or \fqa child\ft ; see Vulgate and Syriac.\f* \w and the one who supported her|strong="H2388"\w*.
\p \v 7 \w But one from her family line|strong="H5342"\w*\f + \fr 11:7 \ft Literally \fqa a branch from her roots\f* \w will rise up|strong="H5975"\w* \w in his place|strong="H3653"\w*, \w come|strong="H935"\w* \w against|strong="H413"\w* \w the army|strong="H2428"\w* \w of the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the North|strong="H6828"\w*, \w and enter|strong="H935"\w* \w his fortress|strong="H4581"\w*, \w fighting|strong="H6213"\w* \w and prevailing|strong="H2388"\w*. \v 8 \w He will take|strong="H935"\w* \w even|strong="H1571"\w* \w their gods|strong="H430"\w* \w captive|strong="H7628"\w* \w to Egypt|strong="H4714"\w*, \w with|strong="H5973"\w* \w their metal images|strong="H5257"\w* \w and their precious|strong="H2532"\w* \w vessels|strong="H3627"\w* \w of silver|strong="H3701"\w* \w and gold|strong="H2091"\w*. \w For some years|strong="H8141"\w* \w he|strong="H1931"\w* \w will stay away|strong="H5975"\w* \w from the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the North|strong="H6828"\w*, \v 9 \w who will invade|strong="H935"\w* \w the realm|strong="H4438"\w* \w of the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the South|strong="H5045"\w* \w and then return|strong="H7725"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w his own land|strong="H127"\w*.
\p \v 10 \w But his sons|strong="H1121"\w* \w will stir up strife|strong="H1624"\w* \w and assemble|strong="H622"\w* \w a great|strong="H7227"\w* \w army|strong="H1995"\w*, \w which will advance forcefully|strong="H935"\w*, \w sweeping through|strong="H5674"\w* \w like a flood|strong="H7857"\w*, \w and will again|strong="H7725"\w* \w carry the battle|strong="H1624"\w* \w as|strong="H5704"\w* \w far as his fortress|strong="H4581"\w*. \v 11 \w In a rage|strong="H4843"\w*, \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the South|strong="H5045"\w* \w will march out|strong="H3318"\w* \w to fight|strong="H3898"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the North|strong="H6828"\w*, \w who will raise|strong="H5975"\w* \w a large|strong="H7227"\w* \w army|strong="H1995"\w*, \w but it|strong="H1995"\w* \w will be delivered|strong="H5414"\w* \w into the hand of his enemy|strong="H3027"\w*.
\p \v 12 \w When the army|strong="H1995"\w* \w is carried off|strong="H5375"\w*, \w the king of the South will be proud|strong="H7311"\w* \w in heart|strong="H3824"\w* \w and will cast down|strong="H5307"\w* \w tens of thousands|strong="H7239"\w*, \w but he will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w triumph|strong="H5810"\w*. \v 13 \w For the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the North|strong="H6828"\w* \w will raise|strong="H5975"\w* \w another|strong="H7725"\w* \w army|strong="H1995"\w*, \w larger|strong="H7227"\w* \w than|strong="H4480"\w* \w the first|strong="H7223"\w*, \w and after|strong="H7093"\w* \w some years|strong="H8141"\w*\f + \fr 11:13 \ft Hebrew \fqa at the end of the times\f* \w he will advance|strong="H935"\w* \w with a great|strong="H1419"\w* \w army|strong="H2428"\w* \w and many|strong="H7227"\w* \w supplies|strong="H7399"\w*.
\p \v 14 \w In those|strong="H1992"\w* \w times|strong="H6256"\w* \w many|strong="H7227"\w* \w will rise up|strong="H5975"\w* \w against|strong="H5921"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the South|strong="H5045"\w*. \w Violent|strong="H6530"\w* \w ones|strong="H1121"\w* \w among your own people|strong="H5971"\w* \w will exalt themselves|strong="H5375"\w* \w in fulfillment|strong="H5975"\w* \w of the vision|strong="H2377"\w*, \w but they will fail|strong="H3782"\w*.
\p \v 15 \w Then the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the North|strong="H6828"\w* \w will come|strong="H935"\w*, \w build up|strong="H8210"\w* \w a siege ramp|strong="H5550"\w*, \w and capture|strong="H3920"\w* \w a fortified|strong="H4013"\w* \w city|strong="H5892"\w*. \w The forces|strong="H2220"\w* \w of the South|strong="H5045"\w* \w will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w stand|strong="H5975"\w*; \w even their best|strong="H4005"\w* \w troops|strong="H5971"\w* \w will not|strong="H369"\w* \w be able|strong="H3581"\w* \w to resist|strong="H5975"\w*. \v 16 \w The invader|strong="H935"\w* \w will do|strong="H6213"\w* \w as he pleases|strong="H7522"\w*, \w and no one|strong="H369"\w* \w will stand|strong="H5975"\w* \w against him|strong="H6440"\w*. \w He will establish himself|strong="H5975"\w* \w in the Beautiful|strong="H6643"\w* \w Land|strong="H776"\w*, \w with destruction|strong="H3617"\w* \w in his hand|strong="H3027"\w*. \v 17 \w He will resolve|strong="H7760"\w* \w to come|strong="H935"\w* \w with the strength|strong="H8633"\w* \w of his whole|strong="H3605"\w* \w kingdom|strong="H4438"\w*, \w and will reach an agreement|strong="H3477"\w* \w with the king of the South|strong="H5973"\w*. \w He will give him a daughter|strong="H1323"\w* \w in marriage|strong="H802"\w* \w in order to overthrow the kingdom|strong="H7843"\w*, \w but his plan will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w succeed|strong="H5975"\w* \w or help|strong="H3808"\w* him.\f + \fr 11:17 \ft Or \fqa but she will not stand with him or support him\f*
\p \v 18 \w Then he will turn|strong="H7725"\w* \w his face|strong="H6440"\w* \w to the coastlands|strong="H339"\w* \w and capture|strong="H3920"\w* \w many of them|strong="H7227"\w*. \w But a commander|strong="H7101"\w* \w will put an end|strong="H7673"\w* \w to his reproach|strong="H2781"\w* \w and will turn it back|strong="H7725"\w* upon him. \v 19 \w After this, he will turn back|strong="H6440"\w* \w toward the fortresses|strong="H4581"\w* \w of his own land|strong="H776"\w*, \w but he will stumble|strong="H3782"\w* \w and fall|strong="H5307"\w* \w and be no more|strong="H3808"\w*.
\p \v 20 \w In|strong="H5921"\w* \w his place|strong="H3653"\w* \w one will arise|strong="H5975"\w* \w who will send out|strong="H5674"\w* \w a tax collector|strong="H5065"\w* \w for the glory|strong="H1925"\w* \w of the kingdom|strong="H4438"\w*; \w but within a few|strong="H259"\w* \w days|strong="H3117"\w* \w he will be destroyed|strong="H7665"\w*, \w though not|strong="H3808"\w* \w in anger|strong="H639"\w* \w or in battle|strong="H4421"\w*.
\p \v 21 \w In|strong="H5921"\w* \w his place|strong="H3653"\w* \w a despicable person|strong="H959"\w* \w will arise|strong="H5975"\w*; \w royal|strong="H4438"\w* \w honors|strong="H1935"\w* \w will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w be given|strong="H5414"\w* \w to him|strong="H5921"\w*, \w but he will come|strong="H935"\w* \w in a time of peace|strong="H7962"\w* \w and seize|strong="H2388"\w* \w the kingdom|strong="H4438"\w* \w by intrigue|strong="H2519"\w*. \v 22 \w Then a flood|strong="H7858"\w* \w of forces|strong="H2220"\w* \w will be swept away|strong="H7857"\w* \w before him|strong="H6440"\w* \w and destroyed|strong="H7665"\w*, \w along with|strong="H1571"\w* \w a prince|strong="H5057"\w* \w of the covenant|strong="H1285"\w*.
\p \v 23 \w After|strong="H4480"\w* \w an alliance is made|strong="H2266"\w* \w with him|strong="H413"\w*, \w he will act|strong="H6213"\w* \w deceitfully|strong="H4820"\w*; \w for he will rise|strong="H5927"\w* \w to power|strong="H6105"\w* \w with only a few|strong="H4592"\w* \w people|strong="H1471"\w*. \v 24 \w In a time of peace|strong="H7962"\w*, \w he will invade|strong="H935"\w* \w the richest|strong="H4924"\w* \w provinces|strong="H4082"\w* \w and do|strong="H6213"\w* \w what|strong="H834"\w* \w his fathers|strong="H1"\w* \w and forefathers|strong="H1"\w* \w never|strong="H3808"\w* \w did|strong="H6213"\w*. \w He will lavish|strong="H967"\w* \w plunder|strong="H961"\w*, \w loot|strong="H7998"\w*, \w and wealth on his followers|strong="H7399"\w*, \w and he will plot|strong="H2803"\w* \w against|strong="H5921"\w* \w the strongholds|strong="H4013"\w* — \w but only for|strong="H5704"\w* \w a time|strong="H6256"\w*.
\p \v 25 \w And with a large|strong="H1419"\w* \w army|strong="H2428"\w* \w he will stir up|strong="H5782"\w* \w his power|strong="H3581"\w* \w and his courage|strong="H3824"\w* \w against|strong="H5921"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the South|strong="H5045"\w*, \w who|strong="H4428"\w* \w will mobilize|strong="H1624"\w* \w a very|strong="H5704"\w* \w large|strong="H1419"\w* \w and powerful|strong="H6099"\w* \w army|strong="H2428"\w* \w but will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w withstand|strong="H5975"\w* \w the plots|strong="H4284"\w* \w devised|strong="H2803"\w* \w against him|strong="H5921"\w*. \v 26 \w Those who eat|strong="H398"\w* \w from his provisions|strong="H6598"\w* \w will seek to destroy him|strong="H7665"\w*; \w his army|strong="H2428"\w* \w will be swept away|strong="H7857"\w*, \w and many|strong="H7227"\w* \w will fall|strong="H5307"\w* \w slain|strong="H2491"\w*.
\p \v 27 \w And the two|strong="H8147"\w* \w kings|strong="H4428"\w*, \w with their hearts|strong="H3824"\w* \w bent on evil|strong="H4827"\w*, \w will speak|strong="H1696"\w* \w lies|strong="H3577"\w* \w at|strong="H5921"\w* \w the same|strong="H259"\w* \w table|strong="H7979"\w*, \w but to no|strong="H3808"\w* \w avail|strong="H6743"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w still|strong="H5750"\w* \w the end|strong="H7093"\w* \w will come at the appointed time|strong="H4150"\w*. \v 28 \w The king of the North will return|strong="H7725"\w* \w to his land|strong="H776"\w* \w with great|strong="H1419"\w* \w wealth|strong="H7399"\w*, \w but his heart|strong="H3824"\w* \w will be set against|strong="H5921"\w* \w the holy|strong="H6944"\w* \w covenant|strong="H1285"\w*; \w so he will do damage|strong="H6213"\w* \w and return|strong="H7725"\w* \w to his own land|strong="H776"\w*.
\p \v 29 \w At the appointed time|strong="H4150"\w* \w he will invade|strong="H935"\w* \w the South|strong="H5045"\w* \w again|strong="H7725"\w*, \w but this time will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w be|strong="H1961"\w* \w like the first|strong="H7223"\w*. \v 30 \w Ships|strong="H6716"\w* \w of Kittim|strong="H3794"\w*\f + \fr 11:30 \ft Or \fqa western coastlands \ft or \fqa Mediterranean islands\f* \w will come|strong="H935"\w* against him, \w and he will lose heart|strong="H3512"\w*. \w Then he will turn back|strong="H7725"\w* \w and rage|strong="H2194"\w* \w against|strong="H5921"\w* \w the holy|strong="H6944"\w* \w covenant|strong="H1285"\w* \w and do damage|strong="H6213"\w*. \w So he will return|strong="H7725"\w* \w and show favor|strong="H995"\w* \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w those who forsake|strong="H5800"\w* \w the holy|strong="H6944"\w* \w covenant|strong="H1285"\w*. \v 31 \w His|strong="H4480"\w* \w forces|strong="H2220"\w* \w will rise up|strong="H5975"\w* \w and desecrate|strong="H2490"\w* \w the temple|strong="H4720"\w* \w fortress|strong="H4581"\w*. \w They will abolish|strong="H5493"\w* \w the daily sacrifice|strong="H8548"\w* \w and set up|strong="H5414"\w* \w the abomination|strong="H8251"\w* \w of desolation|strong="H8074"\w*.
\p \v 32 \w With flattery|strong="H2514"\w* \w he will corrupt|strong="H2610"\w* \w those who violate|strong="H7561"\w* \w the covenant|strong="H1285"\w*, \w but the people|strong="H5971"\w* \w who know|strong="H3045"\w* \w their God|strong="H430"\w* \w will firmly|strong="H2388"\w* \w resist him|strong="H6213"\w*. \v 33 \w Those with insight|strong="H7919"\w* \w will instruct|strong="H995"\w* \w many|strong="H7227"\w*, \w though for a time|strong="H3117"\w* \w they will fall|strong="H3782"\w* \w by sword|strong="H2719"\w* \w or flame|strong="H3852"\w*, \w or be captured|strong="H7628"\w* \w or plundered|strong="H961"\w*.
\p \v 34 \w Now when they fall|strong="H3782"\w*, \w they will be granted|strong="H5826"\w* \w a little|strong="H4592"\w* \w help|strong="H5828"\w*, \w but many|strong="H7227"\w* \w will join|strong="H3867"\w* \w them|strong="H5921"\w* \w insincerely|strong="H2519"\w*. \v 35 \w Some of|strong="H4480"\w* \w the wise|strong="H7919"\w* \w will fall|strong="H3782"\w* \w so that they may be refined|strong="H6884"\w*, \w purified|strong="H1305"\w*, \w and made spotless|strong="H3835"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w the time|strong="H6256"\w* \w of the end|strong="H7093"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w it will still|strong="H5750"\w* \w come at the appointed time|strong="H4150"\w*.
\s1 The King Who Exalts Himself
\p \v 36 \w Then the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w will do|strong="H6213"\w* \w as he pleases|strong="H7522"\w* \w and will exalt|strong="H7311"\w* \w and magnify himself|strong="H1431"\w* \w above|strong="H5921"\w* \w every|strong="H3605"\w* \w god|strong="H410"\w*, \w and he will speak|strong="H1696"\w* \w monstrous things|strong="H6381"\w* \w against|strong="H5921"\w* \w the God|strong="H410"\w* \w of gods|strong="H410"\w*. \w He will be successful|strong="H6743"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w the time of wrath|strong="H2195"\w* \w is completed|strong="H3615"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w what has been decreed|strong="H2782"\w* \w must be accomplished|strong="H6213"\w*. \v 37 \w He will show no regard|strong="H995"\w* \w for|strong="H5921"\w* \w the gods|strong="H430"\w* \w of his fathers|strong="H1"\w*, \w nor|strong="H5921"\w* \w for the one desired|strong="H2532"\w* \w by women|strong="H802"\w*, \w nor|strong="H5921"\w* \w for any|strong="H3605"\w* \w other god|strong="H433"\w*, \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w he will magnify himself|strong="H1431"\w* \w above|strong="H5921"\w* \w them all|strong="H3605"\w*.
\p \v 38 \w And in|strong="H5921"\w* \w their place|strong="H3653"\w*, \w he will honor|strong="H3513"\w* \w a god|strong="H433"\w* \w of fortresses|strong="H4581"\w*— \w a god|strong="H433"\w* \w his fathers|strong="H1"\w* \w did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w know|strong="H3045"\w*— \w with gold|strong="H2091"\w*, \w silver|strong="H3701"\w*, \w precious|strong="H3368"\w* \w stones|strong="H68"\w*, \w and riches|strong="H2532"\w*. \v 39 \w He will attack|strong="H6213"\w* \w the strongest fortresses|strong="H4013"\w* \w with|strong="H5973"\w* \w the help of a foreign|strong="H5236"\w* \w god|strong="H433"\w* \w and will greatly|strong="H7235"\w* \w honor|strong="H3519"\w* \w those who|strong="H834"\w* \w acknowledge him|strong="H5234"\w*, \w making them rulers|strong="H4910"\w* \w over many|strong="H7227"\w* \w and distributing|strong="H2505"\w* \w the land|strong="H127"\w* \w for a price|strong="H4242"\w*.\f + \fr 11:39 \ft Or \fqa for a reward\f*
\p \v 40 \w At the time|strong="H6256"\w* \w of the end|strong="H7093"\w*, \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the South|strong="H5045"\w* \w will engage him in battle|strong="H5055"\w*,\f + \fr 11:40 \ft Hebrew \fqa will thrust at him\f* \w but the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the North|strong="H6828"\w* \w will storm out|strong="H8175"\w* \w against him|strong="H5921"\w* \w with chariots|strong="H7393"\w*, \w horsemen|strong="H6571"\w*, \w and many|strong="H7227"\w* \w ships|strong="H591"\w*, \w invading|strong="H935"\w* \w many countries|strong="H776"\w* \w and sweeping through them|strong="H5674"\w* \w like a flood|strong="H7857"\w*. \v 41 \w He will also invade|strong="H935"\w* \w the Beautiful|strong="H6643"\w* \w Land|strong="H776"\w*, \w and many countries|strong="H7227"\w* \w will fall|strong="H3782"\w*. \w But these|strong="H428"\w* \w will be delivered|strong="H4422"\w* \w from his hand|strong="H3027"\w*: \w Edom|strong="H123"\w*, \w Moab|strong="H4124"\w*, \w and the leaders|strong="H7225"\w* \w of the Ammonites|strong="H1121"\w*.
\p \v 42 \w He will extend|strong="H7971"\w* \w his power|strong="H3027"\w* \w over many countries|strong="H776"\w*, \w and not even|strong="H3808"\w* \w the land|strong="H776"\w* \w of Egypt|strong="H4714"\w* \w will escape|strong="H6413"\w*. \v 43 \w He will gain control|strong="H4910"\w* \w of the treasures|strong="H4362"\w* \w of gold|strong="H2091"\w* \w and silver|strong="H3701"\w* \w and over all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the riches|strong="H2532"\w* \w of Egypt|strong="H4714"\w*, \w and the Libyans|strong="H3864"\w* \w and Cushites|strong="H3569"\w*\f + \fr 11:43 \ft That is, people from the upper Nile region\f* \w will also submit to him|strong="H4703"\w*.
\p \v 44 \w But news|strong="H8052"\w* \w from the east|strong="H4217"\w* \w and the north|strong="H6828"\w* \w will alarm him|strong="H926"\w*, \w and he will go out|strong="H3318"\w* \w with great|strong="H1419"\w* \w fury|strong="H2534"\w* \w to destroy|strong="H8045"\w* \w many|strong="H7227"\w* \w and devote them to destruction|strong="H2763"\w*.\f + \fr 11:44 \ft Forms of the Hebrew \fqa cherem \ft refer to the giving over of things or persons, either by destroying them or by giving them as an offering.\f* \v 45 \w He will pitch|strong="H5193"\w* \w his royal|strong="H643"\w* \w tents|strong="H168"\w* \w between|strong="H996"\w* \w the sea|strong="H3220"\w* \w and the beautiful|strong="H6643"\w* \w holy|strong="H6944"\w* \w mountain|strong="H2022"\w*, \w but he will meet|strong="H935"\w* \w his end|strong="H7093"\w* \w with no one|strong="H369"\w* \w to help|strong="H5826"\w* him.[’’]
\c 12
\s1 The End Times
\r (\ref Revelation 1:1–3|REV 1:1-3\ref*)
\p \v 1 “\w At that|strong="H1931"\w* \w time|strong="H6256"\w* \w Michael|strong="H4317"\w*, \w the great|strong="H1419"\w* \w prince|strong="H8269"\w* \w who stands watch|strong="H5975"\w* \w over|strong="H5921"\w* \w your people|strong="H1121"\w*, \w will rise up|strong="H5975"\w*. \w There will be|strong="H1961"\w* \w a time|strong="H6256"\w* \w of distress|strong="H6869"\w*, \w the likes of which|strong="H834"\w* \w will not have|strong="H3808"\w* \w occurred|strong="H1961"\w* \w from the beginning|strong="H1961"\w* \w of nations|strong="H1471"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w that|strong="H1931"\w* \w time|strong="H6256"\w*. \w But at that|strong="H1931"\w* \w time|strong="H6256"\w* \w your people|strong="H5971"\w* — \w everyone whose name|strong="H3605"\w* \w is found|strong="H4672"\w* \w written|strong="H3789"\w* \w in the book|strong="H5612"\w* — \w will be delivered|strong="H4422"\w*.
\p \v 2 \w And many|strong="H7227"\w* \w who sleep|strong="H3463"\w* \w in the dust|strong="H6083"\w* \w of the earth|strong="H127"\w* \w will awake|strong="H6974"\w*, \w some|strong="H428"\w* \w to everlasting|strong="H5769"\w* \w life|strong="H2416"\w*, \w but others|strong="H428"\w* \w to shame|strong="H2781"\w* \w and everlasting|strong="H5769"\w* \w contempt|strong="H1860"\w*.\f + \fr 12:2 \ft See \ref John 5:29|JHN 5:29\ref* and Revelation 11:18.\f* \v 3 \w Then the wise|strong="H7919"\w* \w will shine|strong="H2094"\w* \w like the brightness|strong="H2096"\w* \w of the heavens|strong="H7549"\w*,\f + \fr 12:3 \ft Or \fqa expanse \ft or \fqa firmament\ft ; see also \ref Genesis 1:6–8|GEN 1:6-8\ref*.\f* \w and those who lead many|strong="H7227"\w* \w to righteousness|strong="H6663"\w* \w will shine like the stars|strong="H3556"\w* \w forever|strong="H5769"\w* \w and ever|strong="H5703"\w*.\f + \fr 12:3 \ft See \ref Matthew 13:43|MAT 13:43\ref*.\f*
\p \v 4 \w But you|strong="H859"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w shut up|strong="H5640"\w* \w these words|strong="H1697"\w* \w and seal|strong="H2856"\w* \w the book|strong="H5612"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w the time|strong="H6256"\w* \w of the end|strong="H7093"\w*. \w Many|strong="H7227"\w* \w will roam to and fro|strong="H7751"\w*, \w and knowledge|strong="H1847"\w* \w will increase|strong="H7235"\w*.”
\p \v 5 \w Then I|strong="H589"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*, \w looked|strong="H7200"\w* \w and saw|strong="H2009"\w* \w two|strong="H8147"\w* \w others|strong="H312"\w* \w standing|strong="H5975"\w* \w there|strong="H2008"\w*, \w one|strong="H259"\w* \w on this bank|strong="H8193"\w* \w of the river|strong="H2975"\w* \w and one|strong="H259"\w* \w on the opposite|strong="H2008"\w* \w bank|strong="H8193"\w*. \v 6 \w One of them said|strong="H559"\w* \w to the man|strong="H376"\w* \w dressed|strong="H3847"\w* \w in linen|strong="H906"\w*, \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w was above|strong="H4605"\w* \w the waters|strong="H4325"\w* \w of the river|strong="H2975"\w*, “\w How long|strong="H4970"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w the fulfillment|strong="H7093"\w* \w of these wonders|strong="H6382"\w*?”
\p \v 7 \w And the man|strong="H376"\w* \w dressed|strong="H3847"\w* \w in linen|strong="H906"\w*, \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w was above|strong="H4605"\w* \w the waters|strong="H4325"\w* \w of the river|strong="H2975"\w*, \w raised|strong="H7311"\w* \w his right hand|strong="H3225"\w* \w and his left hand|strong="H8040"\w* \w toward|strong="H413"\w* \w heaven|strong="H8064"\w*, \w and I heard|strong="H8085"\w* \w him|strong="H853"\w* \w swear|strong="H7650"\w* \w by Him who lives|strong="H2416"\w* \w forever|strong="H5769"\w*, \w saying|strong="H3588"\w*, “\w It will be for a time|strong="H4150"\w*, \w and times|strong="H4150"\w*, \w and half a time|strong="H2677"\w*. \w When the power|strong="H3027"\w* \w of the holy|strong="H6944"\w* \w people|strong="H5971"\w* \w has finally been|strong="H3615"\w* \w shattered|strong="H5310"\w*, \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w these things|strong="H428"\w* \w will be completed|strong="H3615"\w*.”
\p \v 8 \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w heard|strong="H8085"\w*, \w but I did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w understand|strong="H995"\w*. \w So I asked|strong="H559"\w*, “\w My lord|strong="H113"\w*, \w what|strong="H4100"\w* \w will be the outcome|strong="H319"\w* \w of these things|strong="H428"\w*?”
\p \v 9 “\w Go on your way|strong="H1980"\w*, \w Daniel|strong="H1841"\w*,” \w he replied|strong="H559"\w*, “\w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w the words|strong="H1697"\w* \w are closed up|strong="H5640"\w* \w and sealed|strong="H2856"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w the time|strong="H6256"\w* \w of the end|strong="H7093"\w*. \v 10 \w Many|strong="H7227"\w* \w will be purified|strong="H1305"\w*, \w made spotless|strong="H3835"\w*, \w and refined|strong="H6884"\w*, \w but the wicked|strong="H7563"\w* \w will continue to act wickedly|strong="H7561"\w*. \w None|strong="H3808"\w* \w of the wicked|strong="H7563"\w* \w will understand|strong="H995"\w*, \w but the wise|strong="H7919"\w* \w will understand|strong="H995"\w*.
\p \v 11 \w And from the time|strong="H6256"\w* \w the daily sacrifice|strong="H8548"\w* \w is abolished|strong="H5493"\w* \w and the abomination|strong="H8251"\w* \w of desolation|strong="H8074"\w* \w set up|strong="H5414"\w*, \w there will be 1,290|strong="H505"\w* \w days|strong="H3117"\w*. \v 12 \w Blessed is|strong="H835"\w* \w he who waits|strong="H2442"\w* \w and reaches the end|strong="H5060"\w* \w of the 1,335|strong="H505"\w* \w days|strong="H3117"\w*.
\p \v 13 \w But as for you|strong="H859"\w*, \w go on your way|strong="H1980"\w* \w until the end|strong="H7093"\w*. \w You will rest|strong="H5117"\w*, \w and then you will arise|strong="H5975"\w* \w to your inheritance|strong="H1486"\w* \w at the end|strong="H7093"\w* \w of the days|strong="H3117"\w*.”
